## Not covered

The model weights are not distributed here and are not covered by this
licence. `Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf` and `Qwen3.5-0.8B-Q4_K_M.gguf`
carry their own upstream terms; see the Qwen and unsloth model cards.

Raw logs contain model output generated during benchmarking. That text is
included as measurement evidence and inherits whatever terms apply to the
model that produced it.
